  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut pumpkin into thin wedges (peel if preferred).\n• Place pumpkin and Persian spice on the lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper.\n• Toss to coat and roast until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66d055885e32858493913458-a50c4894.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop or crush garlic. In a medium saucepan, melt the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add basmati rice, the water and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil.\n• Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and the water is absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66d055885e32858493913458-659680c6.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While rice is cooking, finely chop cucumber and tomato.\n• In a medium bowl, combine cucumber and tomato. Add a drizzle of white wine vinegar. Season to taste and toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66d055885e32858493913458-d3cebe5e.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir baby spinach through garlic rice and divide between bowls.\n• Top with cucumber salsa and Persian pumpkin. Crumble fetta over the top and serve with a dollop of yoghurt.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66d055885e32858493913458-e4c56489.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
